  "input": {
    "handle": "atoll-misao",
    "title": "Atoll Misao",
    "descriptionHtml": "<p style=\"white-space:pre-wrap;\" data-rte-preserve-empty=\"true\"><span>The Atoll Misao is a high-end, Japanese-made swimming popper designed primarily for big-game offshore fishing. Crafted from wood, it is renowned for its unique slim profile and a specifically angled \"cut\" above the mouth that allows it to generate fine bubbles while swimming in a distinct S-shaped motion.</span></p><p style=\"white-space:pre-wrap;\" data-rte-preserve-empty=\"true\"><span>A \"Swimming Hopper\" action where it dives just below the surface, trailing a bubble line while maintaining a stable S-curve swim.</span></p><p style=\"white-space:pre-wrap;\" data-rte-preserve-empty=\"true\"><span>Its slim, balanced body minimizes air resistance, allowing for long-distance casting even in windy offshore conditions.</span></p><p style=\"white-space:pre-wrap;\" data-rte-preserve-empty=\"true\"><span>Handmade from wood to prioritize natural buoyancy and action, though this makes it more susceptible to damage from high-impact strikes or structural stress compared to plastic lures</span></p><ul data-rte-list=\"default\"><li><p style=\"white-space:pre-wrap;\" data-rte-preserve-empty=\"true\"><span>Length </span>215 mm - Gr. 100</p></li><li><p style=\"white-space:pre-wrap;\" data-rte-preserve-empty=\"true\"><span>Length </span>230 mm - Gr. 105</p></li></ul>",
